  "narrative": {
    "intro": "Domestic Awardees Undisclosed obligated $375M in FY2026 to date. Domestic Awardees Undisclosed won 4,071 awards this fiscal year to date, with an average award size of $92.1K. Domestic Awardees Undisclosed obligations are down 32.0% year over year. Fiscal-year history shows variability: FY21 obligations were $610M, FY22 obligations were $331M, FY23 obligations were $1.1B, FY24 obligations were $1.3B, and FY25 obligations were $552M. Domestic Awardees Undisclosed shows concentration by buyer and market. The Agency for International Development accounted for $346M of FY2026 obligations. The largest NAICS market for Domestic Awardees Undisclosed is Other Scientific and Technical Consulting Services at $275M, followed by All Other Professional, Scientific, and Technical Services at $71.8M. The page notes current-year totals are partial and that listed award-value figures in some tables are total contract values, while the rest are contract obligations.",
    "sections": [
