        "heading": "How did Domestic Awardees Undisclosed perform over time?",
        "body": "Domestic Awardees Undisclosed obligations in FY2026 to date are $375M, down 32.0% year over year. Fiscal history shows swings: FY21 was $610M, FY22 was $331M, FY23 was $1.1B, FY24 was $1.3B, and FY25 was $552M. The current-year total is partial and should be read as fiscal year to date."
      },
      {
        "heading": "Who bought from Domestic Awardees Undisclosed and what were the top markets?",
        "body": "The Agency for International Development bought $346M from Domestic Awardees Undisclosed in FY2026 to date, followed by the Department of the Treasury at $19.3M and the Department of Justice at $16.5M. Other buying agencies include the Department of State at $1.3M and several agencies with smaller or negative obligation entries. The top NAICS markets for Domestic Awardees Undisclosed are Other Scientific and Technical Consulting Services at $275M and All Other Professional, Scientific, and Technical Services at $71.8M."
      }
